PROJECT DESCRIPTION

Creative Paint Studio is a desktop paint application built with Python, Tkinter, and Pillow. It provides a clean creative-studio interface where the user can draw freehand, erase, create shapes, choose colors, adjust brush thickness, undo actions, and open or save image files. The drawing surface is a fixed-size white canvas, while the actual artwork is stored in a Pillow image so that everything drawn on screen is also saved correctly.

To run the program, install Pillow with the command python -m pip install Pillow, then run paint_application.py using Python 3.

